context:
DELETE /wiki/api/v2/whiteboards/{id}
Delete a whiteboard by id. Deleting a whiteboard moves the whiteboard to the trash, where it can be restored later **[Permissions](https://confluence.atlassian.com/x/_AozKw) required**: Permission to view the whiteboard and its corresponding space. Permission to delete whiteboards in the space.
Required: id (path) — The ID of the whiteboard to be deleted.

DELETE /wiki/api/v2/whiteboards/{whiteboard-id}/properties/{property-id}
Deletes a content property for a whiteboard by its id. **[Permissions](https://confluence.atlassian.com/x/_AozKw) required**: Permission to edit the whiteboard.
Required: whiteboard-id (path) — The ID of the whiteboard the property belongs to.; property-id (path) — The ID of the property to be deleted.

GET /wiki/api/v2/whiteboards/{whiteboard-id}/properties/{property-id}
Retrieves a specific Content Property by ID that is attached to a specified whiteboard. **[Permissions](https://confluence.atlassian.com/x/_AozKw) required**: Permission to view the whiteboard.
Required: whiteboard-id (path) — The ID of the whiteboard for which content properties should be returned.; property-id (path) — The ID of the content property being requested.

PUT /wiki/api/v2/whiteboards/{whiteboard-id}/properties/{property-id}
Update a content property for a whiteboard by its id. **[Permissions](https://confluence.atlassian.com/x/_AozKw) required**: Permission to edit the whiteboard.
Required: whiteboard-id (path) — The ID of the whiteboard the property belongs to.; property-id (path) — The ID of the property to be updated.; body (body) — The content property to be updated.
